# Module 3: Docker Architecture

```text
Docker Client
      |
      |
      V
Docker Daemon
      |
      +--> Images
      +--> Containers
      +--> Networks
      +--> Volumes
```

Components:

### Docker CLI

```bash
docker
```

### Docker Daemon

```text
dockerd
```

Handles:

- Build
- Run
- Delete
- Network
- Storage

### Registry

Stores images.

Examples:

- Docker Hub
- AWS ECR
- Azure ACR
- Google Artifact Registry

