# Module 8: Port Mapping

Problem:

Nginx runs inside container.

Container Port:

```text
80
```

Host cannot access it.

Map ports:

```bash
docker run -p 8080:80 nginx
```

Meaning:

```text
Host      Container

8080 ---> 80
```

Open:

```text
http://localhost:8080
```

