# Module 14: Docker Compose

Real applications contain:

```text
Frontend
Backend
Database
Cache
```

Managing manually is difficult.

Docker Compose Example:

```yaml
services:

  frontend:
    image: nginx

  backend:
    image: mybackend

  mysql:
    image: mysql

  redis:
    image: redis
```

Run:

```bash
docker compose up -d
```

Stop:

```bash
docker compose down
```

View:

```bash
docker compose ps
```

---

