# Troubleshooting Guide

Container exits immediately:

```bash
docker logs container_id
```

Port busy:

```bash
sudo lsof -i :8080
```

Image build failure:

```bash
docker build --no-cache .
```

Volume problems:

```bash
docker volume inspect volume_name
```

